"evidence_ids":["link.euler.proposition-8.1"],"id":"euler.proposition-8.1","kind":"claim","label":"Proposition 8.1","locator":"Proposition 8.1, Section 8","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Proposition 8.1.** The data $U_j(0)$ converge in every $C^{m,1/2}$ to an odd divergence-free field $u_0$. In particular, $u_0\\in C^\\infty(\\mathbb T^3;\\mathbb R^3)$. Let $u$ be the maximal smooth solution of the Euler equations from $u_0$, with maximal time $T_*>0$, supplied by Section 1. Then $T_*\\ge T_\\infty$ and, for every $T<T_\\infty$ and integer $m\\ge0$, $U_j\\to u$ in $C([0,T];C^{m,1/2})$. The solution is smooth and odd on $[0,T_\\infty)\\times\\mathbb T^3$.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/euler.proposition-8.1","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/euler.corollary-8.3","id":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.corollary-8.3%22%2C%22euler.proposition-8.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.corollary-8.3%22%2C%22euler.proposition-8.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/euler.proposition-8.1"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/nodes/euler.proposition-8.1","id":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.proposition-8.1%22%2C%22euler.lemma-1.3%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:b6895856d9ff50e16496b37b717873bb085652575bcb8d1394efc1e2e75b460b/edges/%5B%22euler.proposition-8.1%22%2C%22euler.lemma-1.3%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","